WEBVTT

01:37.490 --> 01:42.960
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.280 --> 01:46.020
[Episode 29]

01:46.520 --> 01:47.710
-If you have any complaints...
-Chunqing.

01:47.710 --> 01:48.530
You can...

01:48.870 --> 01:49.430
Shut up!

01:53.360 --> 01:55.160
The concubines in the residence

01:55.310 --> 01:56.560
hated Xia Yingying

01:56.680 --> 01:58.410
deeply,

01:58.479 --> 01:59.930
but towards Chunqing,

01:59.960 --> 02:01.560
they were jealous.

02:01.760 --> 02:05.290
And Hu Wenzhuo's eldest brother,
as Eunuch Xia's subordinate,

02:05.310 --> 02:08.590
had already begun
to investigate this matter.

02:08.870 --> 02:11.800
The result would definitely
be disadvantageous to Chunqing.

02:11.800 --> 02:12.710
So,

02:13.000 --> 02:15.560
I made a deal with the Hu family

02:15.990 --> 02:19.170
to let Chunqing leave the Xie Residence.

02:21.470 --> 02:22.400
So,

02:23.400 --> 02:25.470
you forced my mother

02:25.590 --> 02:27.050
to leave the Xie Residence

02:27.150 --> 02:28.710
and your side for a second time

02:28.710 --> 02:29.680
for...

02:30.560 --> 02:32.280
It was for her own good.

02:34.030 --> 02:36.150
It was to protect her.

02:37.630 --> 02:39.940
I thought if she left the Xie family,

02:40.000 --> 02:41.260
this place of trouble,

02:41.710 --> 02:43.150
she would be safe.

02:43.680 --> 02:45.520
But I never expected

02:47.360 --> 02:49.840
that she was already pregnant
at that time.

02:54.240 --> 02:56.190
Lord Lu even reminded

02:57.150 --> 02:59.470
that fire is forbidden for 3 days
during the Cold Food Festival.

02:59.470 --> 03:01.860
and was afraid you two
wouldn't have enough to eat,

03:01.860 --> 03:03.820
so he sent over some wheat cakes.

03:04.470 --> 03:06.190
♫ Wheat seedlings are green ♫

03:06.280 --> 03:07.790
♫ Mugwort is sweet ♫

03:07.910 --> 03:10.970
♫ The Bodhisattva of the Lu family
spends the cold days ♫

03:11.960 --> 03:13.950
But since things had come to this,

03:14.030 --> 03:16.090
I had to secretly

03:16.150 --> 03:18.560
-to take care of your life.
-It tastes good.

03:18.870 --> 03:21.840
This was the best protection

03:22.079 --> 03:23.800
I could give you.

03:26.750 --> 03:27.280
Mother,

03:27.470 --> 03:28.150
have a bite.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.630
Stop working so tirelessly.

03:31.800 --> 03:34.190
-It's time to find Yunya a father.
-Old Madam,

03:34.190 --> 03:35.280
we should go.

03:37.430 --> 03:38.520
Let's go quickly.

03:54.680 --> 03:55.750
Old Madam.

03:57.000 --> 03:57.800
Chunqing

03:58.680 --> 04:00.030
harbored the rebel,

04:00.580 --> 04:02.160
the son of Shen Zhibai,

04:02.680 --> 04:04.100
so her house was burned down
by the officials.

04:04.100 --> 04:04.680
She...

04:06.000 --> 04:06.750
She

04:09.150 --> 04:09.880
couldn't...

04:11.560 --> 04:12.840
She couldn't escape.

04:17.950 --> 04:19.269
I originally thought

04:20.480 --> 04:22.070
the three of us

04:23.430 --> 04:25.120
still had plenty of time,

04:27.360 --> 04:29.360
and I would definitely find a chance

04:31.720 --> 04:33.580
to bring you and your mother back.

04:34.040 --> 04:36.970
Even if I could only listen from afar

04:37.360 --> 04:39.070
and see that you were safe,

04:41.070 --> 04:43.040
I would be satisfied.

04:43.800 --> 04:45.200
But I never expected that

04:45.920 --> 04:48.580
outside the alley
during the Cold Food Festival

04:53.390 --> 04:56.070
was the last time

04:56.680 --> 05:00.240
we would see each other in this life.

05:09.720 --> 05:11.560
After that fire,

05:14.310 --> 05:15.800
I was sick for 3 days.

05:17.270 --> 05:18.510
Since then,

05:19.120 --> 05:21.920
I became a buddhist and vegetarian.

05:22.430 --> 05:24.760
In the past, I didn't believe in anything.

05:25.270 --> 05:26.730
I only believed in myself,

05:27.480 --> 05:30.480
and only believed in
the things that power and tactics

05:30.800 --> 05:32.390
brought me.

05:33.270 --> 05:34.870
But after Chunqing died,

05:35.680 --> 05:36.600
I was afraid.

05:38.510 --> 05:42.270
I was afraid of the karma in the world.

05:42.390 --> 05:45.240
I thought if I devoted myself
to chanting sutras,

05:46.390 --> 05:49.310
maybe I could
accumulate some trivial merits

05:50.600 --> 05:52.159
in exchange for Chunqing

05:53.480 --> 05:55.409
to not to have such a miserable life

05:56.190 --> 05:58.070
in her next life.

05:59.510 --> 06:00.800
Later,

06:01.720 --> 06:03.600
you followed Granny Chen

06:04.360 --> 06:05.870
and gradually grew up.

06:08.270 --> 06:10.070
Although you lived

06:11.240 --> 06:13.240
a poorer life than in the Xie family,

06:14.040 --> 06:15.270
it was peaceful.

06:16.160 --> 06:18.420
Compared to a cruel grandmother like me,

06:19.830 --> 06:22.240
she is more like your real grandmother.

06:24.920 --> 06:25.870
So,

06:27.630 --> 06:29.480
I tried hard to restrain myself

06:30.720 --> 06:32.750
from disturbing your life.

06:33.800 --> 06:35.430
It was until that day...

06:39.070 --> 06:40.000
Old Madam.

06:40.510 --> 06:42.040
Taoist priest Xin Zhen said

06:42.120 --> 06:43.240
finding a mascot

06:43.390 --> 06:47.120
can eliminate the frequent
strange occurrences in the Xie family.

06:47.950 --> 06:49.120
A mascot?

06:51.630 --> 06:52.870
That is just

06:53.120 --> 06:55.720
some tricks of a warlock.

06:58.830 --> 07:00.040
The mascot

07:01.390 --> 07:03.120
and the blood-written poem...

07:04.950 --> 07:07.320
were that girl's scheme?

07:14.070 --> 07:14.870
Yuejian.

07:16.510 --> 07:18.420
Actually, our Xie Residence

07:18.680 --> 07:20.280
has fourth lady

07:20.680 --> 07:22.480
who has been wandering outside.

07:24.160 --> 07:25.160
Go and find

07:25.270 --> 07:26.270
her whereabouts.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.120
Yes.

07:33.270 --> 07:34.920
This Qingyuan...

07:35.600 --> 07:36.390
I know.

07:37.560 --> 07:38.480
That was all

07:39.510 --> 07:41.159
carefully planned by you

07:42.000 --> 07:43.800
to get into the Xie Residence.

07:44.600 --> 07:46.060
Since you wanted to get in,

07:47.430 --> 07:48.800
I helped you.

07:49.720 --> 07:52.390
Everything you went through
in the Xie Residence,

07:52.390 --> 07:53.750
I know it all.

07:55.680 --> 07:58.390
That wicked Nanny Rong bullied you.

08:00.310 --> 08:01.870
So I found an excuse

08:02.870 --> 08:04.190
and took her life.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.600
Young Master Li

08:08.360 --> 08:10.390
was sincere to you.

08:11.950 --> 08:13.600
I thought of ways

08:14.680 --> 08:16.510
to facilitate this marriage.

08:18.390 --> 08:20.040
And that Yan Rui,

08:20.680 --> 08:21.680
Lord Yan...

08:23.870 --> 08:25.430
How could I not see

08:28.190 --> 08:30.310
his feelings for you?

08:33.200 --> 08:35.669
Many people in the Xie family

08:36.360 --> 08:38.090
saw you as a thorn in their side.

08:38.870 --> 08:39.840
If

08:40.720 --> 08:42.600
Lord Yan protects you,

08:44.150 --> 08:46.270
it might be a way out.

08:46.870 --> 08:47.960
I harbored

08:48.870 --> 08:51.360
the intention of playing along.

08:52.630 --> 08:54.910
But after you entered the Xie Residence,

08:55.720 --> 08:57.390
I secretly made up my mind.

08:58.960 --> 09:01.750
I would do my best to protect you.

09:03.370 --> 09:06.680
I would never let what happened
to your mother

09:08.080 --> 09:10.120
happen to you again.

09:11.720 --> 09:13.580
No one is more heartbroken than me

09:16.870 --> 09:18.550
about your suffering.

09:19.960 --> 09:21.670
But I had no choice.

09:23.360 --> 09:25.080
This was all I could do.

09:29.790 --> 09:31.670
This was all you could do?

09:35.360 --> 09:37.220
If you hadn't insisted that night

09:37.870 --> 09:39.840
on exchanging a daughter for a son,

09:41.270 --> 09:42.320
how would there be

09:43.150 --> 09:45.380
all these subsequent sufferings

09:45.600 --> 09:46.480
and bloodshed?

09:47.510 --> 09:48.720
All of this

09:49.440 --> 09:51.200
started because of you.

09:52.200 --> 09:54.080
What did you do to make up for it?

09:55.480 --> 09:56.870
What you did

09:58.080 --> 10:00.590
was just patching up

10:02.720 --> 10:04.750
your previous mistakes.

10:06.510 --> 10:08.370
You are just deceiving yourself.

10:13.750 --> 10:14.910
Qingyuan,

10:15.440 --> 10:16.700
you don't understand.

10:18.390 --> 10:19.600
You are still young.

10:20.010 --> 10:25.530
[Danyue Pavilion]

10:20.510 --> 10:21.960
Before a woman marries,

10:23.600 --> 10:25.930
she must do her best
for her maiden family.

10:25.960 --> 10:27.390
After marriage,

10:29.000 --> 10:31.530
she must do her best
for her husband's family.

10:31.790 --> 10:33.870
Since I married into the Xie family,

10:35.080 --> 10:35.840
naturally,

10:36.270 --> 10:38.600
passing down the lineage is the priority.

10:39.550 --> 10:42.150
But women cannot inherit
the family business.

10:42.390 --> 10:44.720
This is a rule left by our ancestors.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.440
It's not up to me.

10:48.870 --> 10:50.400
But your surname is not Xie.

10:51.510 --> 10:52.390
Your parents,

10:53.440 --> 10:54.150
daughter,

10:54.960 --> 10:56.420
and your blood relatives—

10:57.120 --> 10:58.780
none of them are surnamed Xie.

10:59.510 --> 11:01.770
The world only knows you as Old Madam Xie,

11:02.600 --> 11:04.480
calling you Old Madam Xie.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.960
While your real name,

11:07.390 --> 11:08.600
Lu Lingshu,

11:09.120 --> 11:11.320
is hidden in the cold bronze mirror,

11:11.870 --> 11:13.080
known to no one.

11:14.120 --> 11:16.250
Those achievements you are so proud of

11:16.840 --> 11:17.600
eventually

11:18.790 --> 11:21.120
all became the title of the Xie Residence.

11:23.030 --> 11:24.870
Is this really what you want?

11:28.510 --> 11:29.670
You are wrong.

11:31.960 --> 11:34.220
When people remember the Xie Residence,

11:36.030 --> 11:37.510
they remember me.

11:39.550 --> 11:41.030
My mind is made up.

11:43.120 --> 11:44.960
I will use my old life

11:46.670 --> 11:48.070
to protect the Xie family

11:49.320 --> 11:50.790
for one last time.

11:53.080 --> 11:54.480
This is my fate,

11:55.480 --> 11:57.080
my destiny.

12:01.960 --> 12:03.420
Before you trade your life

12:04.270 --> 12:05.670
for the Xie family,

12:06.720 --> 12:07.980
have you ever wondered

12:08.720 --> 12:09.510
who exactly

12:11.000 --> 12:12.670
killed my mother?

12:20.440 --> 12:21.390
Wasn't it

12:22.200 --> 12:25.630
because your mother harbored

12:26.600 --> 12:28.240
her friend's orphaned child,

12:28.240 --> 12:29.870
angering the imperial court

12:30.670 --> 12:32.730
and bringing disaster upon herself?

12:33.150 --> 12:33.910
No.

12:35.150 --> 12:36.680
Before the guards arrived,

12:36.790 --> 12:38.320
my mother was already dead.

12:48.360 --> 12:49.360
Before she died,

12:50.390 --> 12:51.990
she wanted to meet you again.

12:52.440 --> 12:54.150
I'll take you downstairs to play tomorrow.

12:54.150 --> 12:54.670
Sure.

12:54.790 --> 12:55.840
I saw there were

12:55.840 --> 12:57.440
a lot of wild pheasants downstairs.

12:57.440 --> 12:58.870
Those are wild ducks.

12:59.150 --> 13:00.720
No matter if they're pheasants or ducks,

13:00.720 --> 13:02.600
let's go downstairs
and catch them tomorrow.

13:02.600 --> 13:03.550
Sure.

13:03.550 --> 13:04.960
Let's get a net and catch a bunch.

13:04.960 --> 13:06.480
Who's still up so late?

13:07.480 --> 13:09.360
You little rascal.

13:09.480 --> 13:10.600
You're so naughty.

13:13.150 --> 13:14.000
Run,

13:14.360 --> 13:15.360
go to sleep early.

13:16.750 --> 13:17.510
Be a good boy.

13:17.510 --> 13:19.840
I'll make you lots of yummy food tomorrow.

13:20.390 --> 13:21.000
Okay!

13:23.440 --> 13:25.130
You little rascal.

13:25.200 --> 13:26.150
I'll spank you.

13:26.720 --> 13:29.050
You didn't even cover yourself properly.

13:54.270 --> 13:55.150
Little Loser.

13:55.790 --> 13:56.590
Little Loser?

14:16.790 --> 14:17.790
Lu Lingshu.

14:18.840 --> 14:20.200
What should I call you?

14:20.960 --> 14:22.240
Should I call you

14:22.390 --> 14:23.320
Old Madam,

14:23.030 --> 14:25.870
[I respectfully address this letter to the dressing table of the revered Old Madame Xie.
I would not dare presumptuously refer to you as mother.]

14:24.120 --> 14:25.080
or

14:25.960 --> 14:26.960
Mother?

14:37.200 --> 14:38.790
Today I finally realized

14:39.600 --> 14:41.630
you didn't protect me

14:42.000 --> 14:43.960
out of courtesy,

14:44.240 --> 14:47.100
nor was it because
I am your daughter-in-law.

14:47.200 --> 14:49.000
It was a mother's

14:49.270 --> 14:52.550
love for her flesh and blood,

14:53.240 --> 14:54.910
and her way to make amends.

15:02.320 --> 15:05.150
But what kind of reason

15:05.550 --> 15:07.270
made it worth doing this?

15:08.030 --> 15:09.910
If you cared about me,

15:10.670 --> 15:12.870
how could you bear to abandon me

15:13.390 --> 15:17.960
and hand me over
to that alcoholic, gambling,

15:18.150 --> 15:20.840
notorious beast,

15:20.840 --> 15:22.600
making me call him

15:23.240 --> 15:24.080
father?

15:25.670 --> 15:28.910
I was treated like an animal
at his command since childhood.

15:28.910 --> 15:30.360
While still young,

15:30.360 --> 15:33.220
I was reduced to making a living
in a theater troupe.

15:33.390 --> 15:34.960
On top of that,

15:35.440 --> 15:37.390
the silver I worked so hard to earn

15:37.390 --> 15:39.590
would be taken away by him immediately.

15:40.150 --> 15:43.280
His creditors harassed me every day.

15:43.550 --> 15:45.150
Even he himself,

15:45.150 --> 15:47.750
more than once when he was drunk,

15:47.910 --> 15:50.440
had filthy thoughts about me.

15:51.630 --> 15:52.670
And you?

15:53.200 --> 15:55.530
You stayed deep within the Xie Residence,

15:55.630 --> 15:57.720
behind countless doors,

15:58.120 --> 16:00.360
just watching me.

16:00.790 --> 16:02.870
Watching me covered in mud

16:03.000 --> 16:04.840
and enduring all kinds of humiliation,

16:04.840 --> 16:08.150
yet never revealing a hint of the truth.

16:08.600 --> 16:11.080
To keep it so watertight,

16:11.670 --> 16:13.630
it must not have been easy for you.

16:26.270 --> 16:28.320
I should have been grateful

16:28.750 --> 16:30.600
for your kindness.

16:31.150 --> 16:32.790
But right now,

16:33.200 --> 16:35.750
how can I not feel hatred?

16:36.270 --> 16:39.080
Yet I can't bring myself
to hate all of this.

16:41.450 --> 16:47.140
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

16:46.750 --> 16:48.870
The real murderer of my mother

16:47.200 --> 16:53.270
♪ Waiting for rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

16:51.440 --> 16:52.960
is your fake son,

16:53.340 --> 16:59.010
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

16:54.030 --> 16:55.030
Xie Shu.

16:59.030 --> 17:05.140
♪ Only then do I understand
right from wrong, and the bitterness ♪

17:03.550 --> 17:04.750
Xie Shu?

17:05.170 --> 17:11.329
♪ Through the courtyard, pear blossoms
flutter like snowflakes in a song ♪

17:11.390 --> 17:17.480
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

17:16.750 --> 17:17.880
That bastard.

17:17.510 --> 17:23.900
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

17:19.680 --> 17:21.440
How dare he kill Chunqing.

17:23.960 --> 17:29.880
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

17:24.069 --> 17:26.480
How dare he kill my daughter!

17:29.970 --> 17:36.100
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

17:36.130 --> 17:42.070
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

17:42.120 --> 17:48.340
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

17:44.200 --> 17:49.750
[Danyue Pavilion]

17:48.360 --> 17:54.360
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

17:52.110 --> 17:54.200
You bastard!

17:56.440 --> 17:57.830
All this karma

17:58.920 --> 18:00.240
and disaster

18:01.590 --> 18:02.590
were deeply seeded

18:02.590 --> 18:04.790
on the night you replaced your daughter

18:05.110 --> 18:06.750
with a boy.

18:16.030 --> 18:17.760
Since things have come to this,

18:18.200 --> 18:20.860
are you still going to
take the blame for Xie Shu?

18:23.350 --> 18:24.830
Can you bear to watch

18:26.350 --> 18:28.590
the murderer who killed your daughter

18:30.000 --> 18:31.530
continue to get away with it

18:33.680 --> 18:35.270
and enjoy a life of luxury?

18:36.590 --> 18:37.750
What did you live

18:38.400 --> 18:39.750
your whole life for?

18:41.400 --> 18:42.860
And what are you dying for?

19:01.200 --> 19:01.880
Wait.

19:03.270 --> 19:04.110
Qingyuan.

19:05.720 --> 19:07.030
Now,

19:07.640 --> 19:08.920
do you hate me?

19:10.960 --> 19:12.720
Can you forgive me?

19:16.030 --> 19:18.830
Can you, for one more time,
call me...

19:19.400 --> 19:20.270
Yes.

19:22.200 --> 19:23.530
I hate that you defended

19:24.200 --> 19:25.510
these unfair rules.

19:26.480 --> 19:28.680
You are the root of all these disasters.

19:30.720 --> 19:32.030
But I pity you more.

19:34.830 --> 19:36.110
Because you are the one

19:38.880 --> 19:40.740
who has been trapped in this house

19:42.200 --> 19:43.240
for the longest.

19:52.680 --> 19:54.610
Don't make the same mistake again,

19:57.880 --> 19:58.680
Grandmother.

20:33.510 --> 20:34.400
Mother.

20:35.550 --> 20:37.140
The sun is high

20:37.440 --> 20:39.240
and half the day is already gone.

20:40.350 --> 20:41.270
I

20:41.590 --> 20:43.520
came specially to pay my respects.

20:47.400 --> 20:48.830
Pay your respects?

20:49.110 --> 20:52.350
I'm afraid
you're reminding me, this old eyesore,

20:54.030 --> 20:55.750
that it's time to pass on.

20:58.790 --> 21:00.350
Mother, why do you say that?

21:00.880 --> 21:02.200
All my life,

21:02.480 --> 21:03.750
my only thought

21:04.160 --> 21:05.590
has been for you

21:05.720 --> 21:07.720
to enjoy longevity and good health.

21:07.720 --> 21:08.880
Only if you are well,

21:09.160 --> 21:11.000
will the Xie family be well.

21:12.510 --> 21:13.640
Bastard.

21:14.680 --> 21:16.030
I originally thought

21:17.720 --> 21:20.440
you still had some true feelings
for Chunqing.

21:22.240 --> 21:24.790
That's why I allowed you to marry her.

21:26.720 --> 21:28.240
But you, despicable man,

21:29.750 --> 21:32.590
took her life with your own hands.

21:37.310 --> 21:38.790
So you knew everything.

21:42.550 --> 21:43.480
That's good too.

21:47.070 --> 21:48.670
Now there are no more secrets

21:48.750 --> 21:49.880
between you and me.

21:50.400 --> 21:52.070
Being completely honest with each other,

21:52.070 --> 21:54.730
this is what a real mother
and son should be like.

21:55.550 --> 21:57.640
But she was my daughter,

21:59.550 --> 22:01.440
my own flesh and blood.

22:04.510 --> 22:06.160
That doesn't sound right.

22:06.520 --> 22:09.920
Since childhood, I have listened
to your earnest teachings.

22:10.350 --> 22:12.010
That's not what you taught me.

22:12.160 --> 22:13.350
You said that

22:13.790 --> 22:16.630
in the face of the Xie clan,

22:16.830 --> 22:18.110
nothing

22:18.350 --> 22:19.350
matters.

22:19.720 --> 22:20.880
Not family,

22:21.160 --> 22:22.030
not friends,

22:22.480 --> 22:24.550
and not even our own lives.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.400
Why today,

22:29.270 --> 22:31.400
are you suddenly getting sentimental

22:31.750 --> 22:33.680
and acting selfishly?

22:35.030 --> 22:36.640
It's not like you

22:37.590 --> 22:39.110
In the eyes of outsiders,

22:40.680 --> 22:43.350
you, Xie Shu, are a highly filial son.

22:44.680 --> 22:46.310
But deep down,

22:48.000 --> 22:49.790
you hate me to the core.

22:51.350 --> 22:52.400
No way.

22:53.070 --> 22:55.270
How could a son hate his mother?

22:55.920 --> 22:57.400
Of course I am a filial son.

22:58.110 --> 23:00.680
I am the most filial son in the world.

23:01.310 --> 23:02.200
And today,

23:02.510 --> 23:05.040
I will carry out
my filial duty to the very end,

23:05.310 --> 23:06.310
Mother.

23:08.510 --> 23:10.110
Don't call me Mother.

23:10.750 --> 23:12.750
Every time you call me that,

23:13.960 --> 23:16.030
I hate you a little more.

23:16.830 --> 23:18.400
Since you were a baby,

23:18.790 --> 23:20.920
I should have seen

23:21.720 --> 23:25.550
that you were born a vicious demon.

23:30.510 --> 23:31.510
Mother,

23:32.030 --> 23:33.760
isn't it a little late for that?

23:37.030 --> 23:37.920
Not at all.

23:39.200 --> 23:41.000
Not late at all.

23:46.070 --> 23:47.960
Arrest him!

24:07.350 --> 24:09.080
Have those disobedient people

24:10.440 --> 24:11.680
been dealt with?

24:12.350 --> 24:14.150
-Yes.
-They've been dealt with.

24:31.070 --> 24:31.880
Mother,

24:32.470 --> 24:33.550
this is the ginseng soup

24:33.550 --> 24:36.000
Yuejian made for you.

24:37.030 --> 24:38.200
Yuejian?

24:40.720 --> 24:42.550
Sixth Concubine.

24:51.310 --> 24:52.550
Bastard.

24:55.160 --> 24:58.510
I was planning to go
keep Chunqing company anyway.

25:00.110 --> 25:00.790
Yes.

25:01.240 --> 25:02.700
But Mother, you're the one

25:02.790 --> 25:06.070
who raised this bastard.

25:11.880 --> 25:13.210
When it comes down to it,

25:13.640 --> 25:15.240
who really killed Chunqing?

25:17.790 --> 25:18.680
It was you.

25:20.270 --> 25:21.790
It was your Xie family.

25:22.510 --> 25:24.640
It was the ancestors of your Xie family

25:24.920 --> 25:26.520
represented by each of those

25:26.920 --> 25:29.440
golden ancestral tablets

25:29.750 --> 25:32.790
who killed her.

25:38.070 --> 25:40.070
Well said.

25:47.070 --> 25:48.200
Lu...

25:48.920 --> 25:49.830
Ling...

25:51.310 --> 25:52.200
Shu...

26:09.110 --> 26:10.270
I know.

26:12.400 --> 26:14.130
The one who deserves to die most

26:15.590 --> 26:17.000
is me.

26:26.160 --> 26:27.640
It's time for me to go.

26:29.750 --> 26:32.110
Farewell, Mother.

26:44.310 --> 26:45.590
Chunqing.

26:47.070 --> 26:52.110
My biggest regret in this life is

26:55.160 --> 26:58.310
that I never held you properly,

27:01.070 --> 27:05.200
nor did I ever hear you call me

27:08.480 --> 27:09.590
"Mother."

27:18.030 --> 27:19.400
Chunqing,

27:22.270 --> 27:24.920
I'm coming to find you.

28:19.680 --> 28:20.510
Mother.

28:26.510 --> 28:28.160
They are all dead.

28:32.640 --> 28:34.240
Grandmother is dead too.

28:41.830 --> 28:42.590
Yunya.

28:43.960 --> 28:44.960
Shen Run.

28:46.750 --> 28:47.640
So,

28:48.590 --> 28:50.920
people really can spend their whole lives

28:51.920 --> 28:54.380
on an empty fame
that doesn't belong to them,

28:55.000 --> 28:56.260
giving up everything,

28:57.350 --> 28:58.950
giving up the ones they love.

29:00.680 --> 29:01.920
At the end, they end up

29:02.960 --> 29:04.920
trapping themselves in a cage,

29:06.720 --> 29:09.160
causing so many tragedies.

29:50.830 --> 29:51.640
Master.

29:52.240 --> 29:53.790
Old Madam's confession

29:53.790 --> 29:55.240
has been sent out.

29:55.640 --> 29:57.440
Please... Please rest assured.

29:58.060 --> 29:58.690
You...

30:02.000 --> 30:03.460
I won't say anything.

30:03.530 --> 30:05.110
I don't know anything!

30:05.880 --> 30:07.290
I won't say anything.

30:10.790 --> 30:11.390
Do you want

30:13.920 --> 30:15.880
to be the second Hu Wenzhuo?

30:18.680 --> 30:20.010
You don't deserve to be.

30:20.200 --> 30:23.110
That old woman married you to me

30:23.240 --> 30:25.070
just to humiliate me.

30:25.200 --> 30:27.050
She just wanted to tell me

30:27.830 --> 30:29.640
that you and I are the same.

30:30.240 --> 30:31.240
From birth,

30:31.830 --> 30:33.680
no matter how smart,

30:33.680 --> 30:35.160
talented,

30:35.590 --> 30:36.750
hardworking,

30:37.240 --> 30:38.590
or good-looking you are,

30:38.590 --> 30:39.880
no one can change

30:40.240 --> 30:42.480
this wretched fate in your bones.

30:58.030 --> 30:59.000
But

30:59.960 --> 31:01.240
I changed it.

31:04.880 --> 31:06.240
Changed it completely.

31:06.880 --> 31:08.340
The Xie family is mine now.

31:09.720 --> 31:11.160
The Xie family's

31:12.160 --> 31:15.110
century-old foundation is all mine.

31:42.700 --> 31:43.160
[A lifetime of fame and success,
yet I never knew the truth.]

31:43.160 --> 31:43.660
[My biological daughter was left away from home
and died tragically in a fire.]

31:45.270 --> 31:47.110
This is the minister I trust.

31:48.160 --> 31:50.090
His methods are indeed brilliant.

31:50.590 --> 31:53.240
Xie Shu has inherited
the Xie Residence for decades

31:53.240 --> 31:55.110
and greatly benefited
from the Xie family's protection.

31:55.110 --> 31:56.030
Now,

31:56.030 --> 31:58.510
he claims not to know
his background and origins,

31:58.510 --> 32:00.510
which is truly unconvincing to the public.

32:00.510 --> 32:02.550
Xie Shu is well aware of this.

32:03.310 --> 32:04.910
He sent a confession letter,

32:05.000 --> 32:06.570
betting on Your Majesty to accept

32:06.570 --> 32:09.640
his sincerity in offering
his adoptive mother's life as an apology.

32:09.640 --> 32:11.370
It is easy to be a foolish ruler,

32:11.720 --> 32:13.580
and not difficult to be a wise one.

32:14.110 --> 32:16.640
The hardest part
is knowing that your subjects

32:16.640 --> 32:17.680
are patronizing to your face

32:17.680 --> 32:18.830
and hypocritical,

32:19.440 --> 32:22.440
but for the sake of the big picture,
I have to keep them!

32:25.510 --> 32:27.480
Your Majesty wishes
to implement new policies,

32:27.480 --> 32:29.750
and shouldn't be hindered
by those of the past.

32:29.750 --> 32:30.680
Lord Ye,

32:31.550 --> 32:32.950
within this deep palace,

32:34.000 --> 32:35.330
to govern a vast empire,

32:36.000 --> 32:37.330
one must rely on people.

32:39.240 --> 32:40.240
To rely on people,

32:41.480 --> 32:43.480
one must turn a blind eye

32:43.960 --> 32:45.310
to their selfish desires,

32:45.310 --> 32:47.070
and tolerate being deceived.

32:48.350 --> 32:51.030
Of course,
I could have Xie Shu sliced to pieces,

32:51.240 --> 32:52.240
set things right,

32:52.680 --> 32:54.080
cut off old corruptions,

32:54.350 --> 32:56.880
and immediately implement
the new policies.

32:57.640 --> 32:59.770
But Xia's faction has just retreated,

33:00.310 --> 33:02.040
and the court is not yet stable.

33:02.920 --> 33:05.110
Without Xie Shu to balance things out,

33:05.680 --> 33:08.070
the gentry and noble families of Hengtang

33:08.590 --> 33:10.250
would be a sheet of loose sand.

33:10.350 --> 33:11.510
Even I

33:12.240 --> 33:13.840
could do nothing about them.

33:14.880 --> 33:15.680
Your Majesty!

33:15.750 --> 33:18.010
I have to focus on the overall interests.

33:20.960 --> 33:23.360
Although accumulated corruptions exist,

33:27.200 --> 33:29.640
the people can still carry
the burden and move forward.

33:29.640 --> 33:31.440
But once the country falls into chaos,

33:31.440 --> 33:34.370
there will be far worse
factional disputes and wars.

33:35.880 --> 33:37.410
Implementing new policies

33:38.110 --> 33:40.170
requires slow pushing and enduring,

33:41.640 --> 33:43.770
outlasting one Xie Shu after another.

33:50.750 --> 33:51.880
This matter,

33:53.440 --> 33:54.590
let it end here.

33:55.960 --> 33:58.310
Since Old Madam Xie
has apologized with her life,

33:58.310 --> 34:01.170
I will leave the Xie family
with their last fig leaf.

34:01.880 --> 34:03.140
Let's leave it at that.

34:28.150 --> 34:29.760
Do you think

34:31.070 --> 34:33.440
you're a phoenix?

34:33.960 --> 34:39.030
You're nothing but a beast kept in a cage.

34:39.670 --> 34:41.400
Someday, when I'm in a good mood,

34:41.400 --> 34:42.440
I'll pluck your feathers,

34:42.440 --> 34:43.710
slice your meat,

34:43.710 --> 34:45.550
and see how you taste.

34:47.360 --> 34:48.230
Did you hear me?

34:52.260 --> 34:53.850
Xie Shu!

34:54.000 --> 34:55.110
Xie Shu.

34:55.469 --> 34:56.750
Xie Shu.

34:56.780 --> 34:58.320
Xie Shu.

34:58.350 --> 34:59.480
Xie Shu!

34:59.480 --> 35:00.780
Xie Shu.

35:00.820 --> 35:01.750
Xie Shu!

35:01.750 --> 35:02.900
Xie Shu.

35:02.930 --> 35:04.300
Xie Shu.

35:04.620 --> 35:06.110
Xie Shu.

35:06.140 --> 35:07.140
Xie Shu!

35:07.170 --> 35:08.560
Xie Shu!

35:09.060 --> 35:10.190
Xie Shu.

35:10.470 --> 35:11.470
Xie Shu.

35:11.500 --> 35:12.810
Xie Shu.

35:16.230 --> 35:18.010
Xie Shu.

35:20.780 --> 35:22.410
Xie Shu?

35:22.710 --> 35:24.320
All of you, come out!

35:26.000 --> 35:27.760
The patriarch is here.

35:28.000 --> 35:29.600
The patriarch is right here!

35:31.030 --> 35:32.400
Where are you!

35:40.170 --> 35:41.550
When I catch you,

35:41.550 --> 35:43.880
I'll skin you alive, one by one.

35:47.110 --> 35:48.070
Qingrong!

35:48.670 --> 35:49.630
Donglin!

35:50.110 --> 35:51.710
Don't let me catch you!

35:56.280 --> 35:58.110
Is there anyone alive?

36:01.510 --> 36:02.800
You little brats...

36:03.590 --> 36:05.440
You little brats,

36:06.320 --> 36:07.550
get out here!

36:08.000 --> 36:09.150
Where is everyone?

36:09.500 --> 36:09.830
[Fuyu Pavilion]

36:09.890 --> 36:10.140
[Danyue Pavilion]

36:10.820 --> 36:11.820
[Hanxiang Parlor]

36:11.890 --> 36:12.500
[Huifang Garden]

36:20.920 --> 36:21.280
Master.

36:21.280 --> 36:22.320
Where are you going?

36:22.320 --> 36:23.280
Got you!

36:24.000 --> 36:25.190
Let me ask you,

36:25.280 --> 36:26.610
where did all of them go?

36:27.710 --> 36:29.440
-Master...
-Where is Sixth Madam?

36:29.440 --> 36:30.840
Sixth Madam has gone mad.

36:31.190 --> 36:32.650
She was sent to the estate.

36:38.880 --> 36:39.940
I have to leave too.

36:39.960 --> 36:40.590
Master,

36:41.280 --> 36:42.840
my old mother is seriously ill at home.

36:42.840 --> 36:44.110
The kindness you've shown me,

36:44.110 --> 36:45.440
I will always remember.

36:51.000 --> 36:51.840
Hengtang

36:52.400 --> 36:54.800
now belongs to me, Xie Shu, alone.

36:54.800 --> 36:56.920
Donglin, it's ours now!

36:56.920 --> 36:58.410
Donglin... Hey! Dong...

36:58.710 --> 37:00.320
I was about to promote you!

37:01.190 --> 37:02.000
Donglin!

37:05.000 --> 37:06.400
Bastard!

37:13.910 --> 37:22.610
♪ The immortal with green hair ♪

37:24.850 --> 37:32.430
♪ Lazy and flirtatious ♪

37:33.320 --> 37:41.950
♪ Drinking toasts ♪

37:43.450 --> 37:58.110
♪ A furrowed brow betrays her sorrow ♪

37:58.880 --> 37:59.880
Chunqing?

38:01.080 --> 38:18.620
♪ Why keep your heart
so guarded against me? ♪

38:41.480 --> 38:43.080
You called my mother's name.

38:43.630 --> 38:44.550
It seems

38:45.710 --> 38:47.110
you still care about her.

38:50.110 --> 38:51.230
Qingyuan.

38:55.400 --> 38:56.920
So beautiful.

38:58.280 --> 38:59.590
Well sung, Qingyuan.

39:06.230 --> 39:08.360
This is your mother's dress.
